[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
ServiceTypes=Krita/PythonPlugin
X-KDE-Library=steady
X-Python-2-Compatible=false
Name=Steady
Comment=Hands-free painting: lets the Steady helper (camera pointer + voice) change brush, colour, size, opacity and layers. Listens on 127.0.0.1:8766 only. Tested on Krita 5.3.
